{
  "name": "Orbit AI - Phase 2 - DNC / restriction check (W2.6, action-layer block)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bcd84b1e-cef4-4f83-94b9-2904bc282a93",
      "name": "DNC check webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-700, 0],
      "webhookId": "PLACEHOLDER_WEBHOOK_ID",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dnc-check",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "This is the 'hard action-layer block requiring logged admin override for exception calls' half of W2.6 - the other half (role-based hiding in the dialer UI) is a permissions config, not a workflow. Meant to be called SYNCHRONOUSLY by the dialer's own call-placement action before it ever dials, per §5/§13's framing that this is a block at the action layer, not just advisory. Input contract: {opportunityId: string, overrideRequested?: boolean, overrideBy?: string} - overrideBy should be the requesting agent's identifier, since an override without one can't be 'logged' meaningfully."
    },
    {
      "id": "0f34a35e-9d8a-4adf-bdf2-ffc7921f6a37",
      "name": "Fetch Opportunity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-460, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.TWENTY_CRM_BASE_URL }}/rest/opportunities/{{ $json.body.opportunityId }}",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "name": "Twenty CRM API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "ASSUMES the Restriction Reason (DNC/Not Interested/Bad Information) and Post-Loss Track (Nurture/Restricted) fields from CRM Architecture §13's post-loss routing section live directly on the Opportunity - same Twenty CRM REST-shape uncertainty as every other workflow in this library."
    },
    {
      "id": "e09f5451-7c5f-49ed-92b6-650d66069dd6",
      "name": "Is DNC?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-220, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.restrictionReason }}",
              "rightValue": "DNC",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33360b0d-9bbb-4127-b2cc-cf203d00a0b6",
      "name": "Override requested & logged?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [20, -80],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('DNC check webhook').item.json.body.overrideRequested }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('DNC check webhook').item.json.body.overrideBy }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ab733033-d958-427a-809b-276b597dd306",
      "name": "Log override to Activity Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [260, -140],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.TWENTY_CRM_BASE_URL }}/rest/activityEvents",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ opportunityId: $('DNC check webhook').item.json.body.opportunityId, type: 'DncOverride', by: $('DNC check webhook').item.json.body.overrideBy, at: new Date().toISOString() }) }}",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "name": "Twenty CRM API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Writes to the Activity Event timeline from CRM Architecture §13 - the append-only log an override like this has to land in for 'logged admin override' to mean anything. Endpoint/shape is this workflow's own reasonable guess at how Activity Event gets written to, not confirmed - it's a newer concept in §13 with no worked API example. CONFIRMED unchanged by the object model migration (CRM-OBJECT-MODEL.md): restrictionReason is checked/logged against the Opportunity, consistent with post-loss routing staying a pre-sale/deal-level concept, not moved to Location or Company."
    },
    {
      "id": "83f9286b-e324-4ecb-8b53-2073f2f06038",
      "name": "Respond: allowed (override)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [500, -140],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ allowed: true, reason: 'DNC override logged' }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b567ae87-20e0-4519-9bd7-112c7a76d67d",
      "name": "Respond: blocked",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [260, 20],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseCode": 403,
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ allowed: false, reason: 'DNC - no override provided' }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e9a2c551-4878-4c03-a4f1-9fcfc531e2d6",
      "name": "Respond: allowed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [20, 120],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ allowed: true }) }}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "DNC check webhook": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Fetch Opportunity", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Fetch Opportunity": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Is DNC?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Is DNC?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Override requested & logged?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Respond: allowed", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Override requested & logged?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Log override to Activity Event", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Respond: blocked", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Log override to Activity Event": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond: allowed (override)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "errorWorkflow": "PLACEHOLDER_ALERT_WORKFLOW_ID"
  }
}
